## 1. Overview

The **CodeMind Code Intelligence License** ("License") allows individuals, students, educators, researchers, developers, startups, organizations, and businesses to freely use and build upon the CodeMind artificial intelligence model, subject to the terms of this License.

The goal of this License is to allow CodeMind to be used broadly for learning, research, experimentation, software development, commercial products, startups, education, and other legitimate purposes while preserving proper credit to the original developer.

The model covered by this License is referred to as the **"Licensed Model."**

